# Optional blocklist of org-specific literals for the `mars-internal-refs`
# pre-commit check (scripts/check_internal_refs.sh).
#
# HOW TO USE
#   cp scripts/.internal-blocklist.template scripts/.internal-blocklist
#   then add ONE term per line below (real private-repo names, internal storage
#   account, DB host prefix, internal git host, internal usernames, ...).
#
# The real `scripts/.internal-blocklist` is git-ignored, so these literals never
# land in this public repo. Matching is case-insensitive substring. Lines that
# are empty or start with `#` are ignored. If the file is absent, this sub-check
# is skipped and the generic shape-based patterns still apply.
#
# Replace the placeholders below with your real values (in the private file only):
#   <private-repo-name>
#   <another-private-repo-name>
#   <internal-storage-account-name>
#   <internal-db-host-prefix>
#   <internal-git-host>
#   <internal-username>
